    {
      "id": "source",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 40,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Base: the Figma wireframe (11 frames, no variables or styles defined).\n\nThe tokens here reconcile three sources that had drifted apart \u2014 the wireframe's sampled colours, the web prototype's CSS variable ramps, and the React Native build's flat palette."
    },
    {
      "id": "theming",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 4920,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "The wireframe's strongest idea: the quiz sorts you into a type, and the type owns a surface colour for the rest of the product.\n\nThe shipped build dropped it \u2014 everything ships as the Optimizer, in forest green. Restoring it costs three token values per theme."
    }
  ],
